{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Welcome to the Rough Souls: Adventures Demo!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This free demo offers a hands-on experience with the core gameplay mechanics of <i>Rough Souls: Adventures</i> through a fully playable tutorial island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this demo, you can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Begin your journey in <strong>Adventure Mode</strong> and explore a limited area of the game world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn the basics of <strong>Saiga riding</strong>, including movement and handling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face off against a powerful <strong>Souls-style boss</strong>, testing your combat skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try out the <strong>duel system</strong> by challenging a champion-level opponent</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover how to <strong>earn money and resources</strong> through in-game actions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo includes the first section of the game and is designed to give you a feel for the gameplay, mechanics, and style of <i>Rough Souls: Adventures</i>. Progress is limited to the tutorial island and some early-game systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We hope you enjoy your first steps into the world of <i>Rough Souls</i>!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3763400?t=1748509842","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3763400?t=1748509842","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763400/4004c6a213c3bc48e16d80e941f3c5e0691cf2d0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748509842","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763400/4004c6a213c3bc48e16d80e941f3c5e0691cf2d0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748509842","categories":[{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Welcome to the Rough Souls: Adventures Demo!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This free demo offers a hands-on experience with the core gameplay mechanics of <i>Rough Souls: Adventures</i> through a fully playable tutorial island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this demo, you can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Begin your journey in <strong>Adventure Mode</strong> and explore a limited area of the game world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn the basics of <strong>Saiga riding</strong>, including movement and handling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face off against a powerful <strong>Souls-style boss</strong>, testing your combat skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try out the <strong>duel system</strong> by challenging a champion-level opponent</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover how to <strong>earn money and resources</strong> through in-game actions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo includes the first section of the game and is designed to give you a feel for the gameplay, mechanics, and style of <i>Rough Souls: Adventures</i>. Progress is limited to the tutorial island and some early-game systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We hope you enjoy your first steps into the world of <i>Rough Souls</i>!</p>","developers":["Zsolti"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2591470","name":"Rough Souls: Adventures"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763400/bf1443b46a7f34add415badd762d289a8978662d/header.jpg?t=1748509842","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recomme